%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a colour key compares raw samples. An 8x1 four-bit
% DeviceGray type 4 image with Decode [1 0] and MaskColor [0 3]: the
% raw samples 0, 2, 3, and 1 are kept off the page although they decode
% to the lightest greys, and 4, 8, 15, and 12 are painted, 15 as black.
/backdrop {
  0.3 setgray 0 0 1 1 rectfill
  0 setgray 0 0.25 0.75 { 0 0.125 1 rectfill } for
} def
gsave
100 400 translate 200 200 scale
backdrop
<< /ImageType 4 /Width 8 /Height 1 /BitsPerComponent 4
   /ImageMatrix [8 0 0 -1 0 1] /Decode [1 0]
   /MaskColor [0 3]
   /DataSource <02348FC1> >> image
grestore
showpage
